  = help: the trait `RowButtons` is not implemented for `Arity<6>`
  = note: `Arity<6>` is the number of buttons; for a length known only at runtime use ActionRow::try_buttons(buttons, &limits)
  = help: the following other types implement trait `RowButtons`:
            Arity<1>
            Arity<2>
            Arity<3>
            Arity<4>
            Arity<5>
